      "writtenOn": "2021-11-17T14:46:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because we have limited RAM in the TA for both data structures and also code. So we really want to re-use the existing code.\n\nAs for a new error code, I\u0027m not sure why you think that\u0027s necessary. The only caller of this - credstore - absolutely knows whether an IIdentityCredential was obtained for a session or not.",
      "parentUuid": "b768060b_df4b7d02",
