      "message": "This runs contrary to the factory pattern.\n\nThe factory function should take all the parameters and return an object if it can make a valid one. Deferring all the initialization, error handling, and cleanup to every user of the factory is odd -- why shouldn\u0027t the factory do this for everyone who wants a proxy?",
